den's sidebar plate (spec, "Look and layout", variant B): every Repo of the
watched Owners, grouped under its Owner, on surface 1. Rust windows the rows to
the plate's height and draws each one on its own (`SidebarRow`): a `for` over
the rows would clone the whole row list once per element.

Sentinels as in frame.crepus. Meaning never rides on colour alone:
  mark    the rust tick on the cursor row while the sidebar has focus
  scope   a glyph on the row that is the current Scope
  icons   fork and archived are glyphs
  upstream  a fork that targets its Upstream (#13): the "upstream →" label, in rust
  flag    incomplete coverage (filled by #8) is a glyph
  count   Work Items with a Next Step, or a faint dot for none; Rust
          right-aligns it in five cells (a blank always before it), and a
          blank cell after it keeps it off the rail.

Every SidebarRow branch has the same columns (a heading's icons are empty), so
one budget is true whichever branch a row takes, the cursor's included. Rust
cuts the label to what those fixed columns leave (`ui::sidebar`), so keep the
two in step.

--- Sidebar
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0001] pt-1
  div h-[1] flex-row px-1 text-[#aa000a]
    span flex-1 "{sidebar_label}"
    span w-[10] text-[#aa0008] "{position}"
  div h-[1]
  div flex-1

--- SidebarRow
div w-full h-full flex-col bg-[#aa0001]
  if {cursor}
    div h-[1] flex-row bg-[#aa0017]
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000b] "{mark}"
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000b] "{scope_mark}"
      span flex-1 font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{label}"
      if {has_upstream}
        span w-[11] font-bold text-[#aa000b] "{upstream}"
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[2] text-[#aa0016] "{icons}"
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
      span w-[5] text-[#aa000b] "{count}"
      span w-[1] " "
  else if {heading}
    div h-[1] flex-row
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000b] "{scope_mark}"
      if {current}
        span flex-1 font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{label}"
      else
        span flex-1 text-[#aa000a] "{label}"
      if {has_upstream}
        span w-[11] font-bold text-[#aa000b] "{upstream}"
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[2] text-[#aa0016] "{icons}"
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
      span w-[5] text-[#aa0007] "{count}"
      span w-[1] " "
  else if {current}
    div h-[1] flex-row
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000b] "{scope_mark}"
      span flex-1 font-bold text-[#aa0006] "{label}"
      if {has_upstream}
        span w-[11] font-bold text-[#aa000b] "{upstream}"
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[2] text-[#aa0016] "{icons}"
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
      span w-[5] text-[#aa0009] "{count}"
      span w-[1] " "
  else if {busy}
    div h-[1] flex-row
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[1] " "
      span flex-1 text-[#aa0005] "{label}"
      if {has_upstream}
        span w-[11] font-bold text-[#aa000b] "{upstream}"
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[2] text-[#aa0016] "{icons}"
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
      span w-[5] text-[#aa0009] "{count}"
      span w-[1] " "
  else
    div h-[1] flex-row
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[1] " "
      span flex-1 text-[#aa0007] "{label}"
      if {has_upstream}
        span w-[11] font-bold text-[#aa000b] "{upstream}"
      span w-[1] " "
      span w-[2] text-[#aa0016] "{icons}"
      span w-[1] text-[#aa000f] "{flag}"
      span w-[5] text-[#aa0008] "{count}"
      span w-[1] " "
